<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Hire purchase or SACCO loan</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>{@nm@} wants a {@itm@} that costs Ksh \({@ksh(C)@}\) cash.</p><p>Option 1, hire purchase: a deposit of Ksh \({@ksh(Dep)@}\) and \({@k@}\) monthly instalments of Ksh \({@ksh(m)@}\).</p><p>Option 2: borrow Ksh \({@ksh(C)@}\) from a SACCO at \({@R@}\%\) per annum simple interest, repaying it all over \({@mo@}\) months.</p><p>(a) Find the total cost of option 1.</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) Find the total repaid to the SACCO.</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>(c) Which option costs less? [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p><p>(d) By how much?</p><p>Ksh [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) Hire purchase: \({@ksh(Dep)@} + {@k@} \times {@ksh(m)@} = {@ksh(Dep)@} + {@ksh(km)@} = {@ksh(H)@}\).</p><p>(b) \({@mo@}\) months is \({@dd(mo/12)@}\) year[[if test="is(mo>12)"]]s[[/if]]. Interest \(= \dfrac{{@ksh(C)@} \times {@R@} \times {@dd(mo/12)@}}{100} = {@ksh(SI)@}\), so the SACCO is repaid \({@ksh(C)@} + {@ksh(SI)@} = {@ksh(S)@}\).</p><p>(c) and (d) [[if test="is(ky=1)"]]Hire purchase costs less, by \({@ksh(S)@} - {@ksh(H)@} = {@ksh(dif)@}\).[[else]]The SACCO loan costs less, by \({@ksh(H)@} - {@ksh(S)@} = {@ksh(dif)@}\).[[/if]] Paying cash is cheapest of all, if you have the money.</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>4</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: credit plan against the cash price, with a SACCO loan option. [item, cash C, deposit, k, instalment m, SACCO rate R, months mo]. HP cheaper on 5 entries, SACCO on 5. Source: adapted from SMP GCSE Foundation book 2, chapter 10, T4. */
L: [["motorbike",150000,30000,18,8200,14,18],["fridge",45000,9000,12,3500,12,12],["laptop",70000,10000,12,6000,15,12],["dairy cow",90000,20000,10,7600,16,12],["tuk-tuk",420000,100000,24,18500,13,24],["solar kit",38000,8000,12,2900,18,12],["water tank",52000,12000,15,3400,12,18],["sewing machine",26000,5000,10,2400,15,12],["greenhouse kit",120000,25000,18,7300,14,24],["posho mill",180000,40000,24,7000,15,24]];
E: L[ix];
itm: E[1]; C: E[2]; Dep: E[3]; k: E[4]; m: E[5]; R: E[6]; mo: E[7];
nm: ["Achieng","Kiprono","Wanjiru","Omondi","Nekesa","Mutua","Chebet","Barasa","Njeri","Hassan"][ix];
H: Dep+k*m;
S: C+C*R*(mo/12)/100;
ky: if H<S then 1 else 2;
nky: 3-ky;
dif: abs(H-S);
/* diagnostics */
km: k*m;
CD: C+Dep;
SI: C*R*(mo/12)/100;
Smy: C+C*R*mo/100;
h3: H+300;
d3: abs(H+300-S);
opt3: [[1, is(ky=1), "Hire purchase"], [2, is(ky=2), "The SACCO loan"]];
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
